{
	title: "Modifying Spells",
	x: -8.0d,
	y: 3.0d,
	shape: "gear",
	text: [
		"Once a spell has been applied to a Gramary, it can be further §6modified§r to change how it functions. ",
		"",
		"Place your staff that contains the spell onto an §6Imposer§r, and right-click it with a §6knife§r. ",
		"",
		"Select the spell you want to §6modify§r, then apply 1 of the items needed to §6unlock§r the modifier. ",
		"",
		"Once the modifier is unlocked, it can be §6toggled§r on and off on the same screen.",
		"",
		"As an example, \"§6Acid Cloud§r\" can be turned into \"§6Healing Cloud§r\" by applying §6Terra Moss§r.",
		"",
		"Note that some modifiers are completely disabled in this pack."
	],
